      "size" : 12,
      "text" : "Numitron counter\n\nG1 32.768 kHz / 16384 (U1) = 2 Hz into the 7490 (U2).\nThe 7447 (U3) sinks the IV-9's segments; the common\nlead goes to +5 V through D1 and D2, which drop the rail\nto about 3.5 V (segments 3.15 V nominal, 4.5 V max).\n\nP1: 1 = +5 V, 2 = GND.",
      "x" : 420,
      "y" : -130
    }
  ],
